      "updated_at": "2019-09-02T09:48:02Z",
      "body": ">What happens if a user is in neither the UK nor the EU/EEA?\r\n\r\nThey don't get a cookie banner at all (this isn't what Simorgh does, it's what the new logic above would be if using our ORBIT system). In simorgh we show the cookie banner to all canonical users and only EU/EEA on AMP (because it was an articles shortcut to live).",
